	('acd2ae6e-869b-421b-bb87-e4ab022b37e1', 'ca9d6d62-a247-434b-8184-b1e9154b2242', 'Riaz is a highly considerate individual with a natural leaning towards making others comfortable, demonstrated by scores of 80 in traits 2 and 4. Yet, Riaz shows an equally respectable balance, displayed through scores of 20 and 40 in traits 1 and 3, leaning towards self-assured decision making.', true, '2025-01-29 22:15:13.62892+00'),
	('30b6540d-dad3-4703-9cc1-a2a1aa7b77e3', 'ca9d6d62-a247-434b-8184-b1e9154b2242', 'Riaz appears to be an ambitious and extroverted person with strong interpersonal skills. They''re enthusiastic and greatly value social connections, with a tendency to prefer comfort and stability. Remember, this is a brief interpretation and individuals are always more complex.', true, '2025-01-29 22:15:14.100524+00'),
	('370598d8-b812-420c-a82f-be56093f3dbc', 'ca9d6d62-a247-434b-8184-b1e9154b2242', 'Riaz is incredibly self-sufficient and resourceful with a great knack for problem-solving. They''re motivated and ambitious, always endeavoring towards their goals with great passion and energy. Riaz thrives in social interactions and values connection with others.', true, '2025-01-29 22:15:15.321134+00'),
	('53d1d1b5-7e5a-489e-8d1c-1892b46698b4', 'ca9d6d62-a247-434b-8184-b1e9154b2242', 'Riaz is an impressive balance of ambition and approachability. With high scores in traits 2 and 4, they''re likely a focused achiever who enjoys connecting and collaborating with others. Their enthusiasm and charm make them a delightful presence in any social setting.', true, '2025-01-29 22:15:20.191649+00'),
	('0bc973b0-c0d4-4add-90aa-07501833b2ee', 'ca9d6d62-a247-434b-8184-b1e9154b2242', 'This person appears to be very practical and persistent yet open-minded and innovative. They have a good balance between being detail-oriented and big-picture thinking, which makes them versatile in many aspects of life.', true, '2025-01-29 22:15:13.802399+00'),
	('48c418db-8cd9-427d-9de7-98c28a63bf82', 'ca9d6d62-a247-434b-8184-b1e9154b2242', 'Riaz is a delightful individual who displays high energy and motivation. They tend to be very decisive and communicative, embracing opportunities for challenges and enhancing relationships. They also appreciate structure and reliability. All these make them truly admirable.', true, '2025-01-29 22:15:14.806289+00'),
	('b245277f-632e-40f4-8e4a-33390fe470fd', 'ca9d6d62-a247-434b-8184-b1e9154b2242', 'Riaz appears to be a balanced individual who leans towards being a forward-thinker and is highly focused. They likely plan ahead and are quite thorough in their actions. While they have a moderate level of flexibility, their high resilience helps them handle challenges with ease.', true, '2025-01-29 22:15:15.846083+00'),
